# The tray (0.0.5h): the chevron left of the lock pills on the taskbar
# opens the quick settings; Night light tints the screen; a notification
# sent from the shell appears in its history. 1280x800: the tray button is
# at about x=1044, y=770; the tray's first toggle (Night light) is its
# top-left button.
gui: desktop up at 1280x800
cerberus kernel shell
!key notify remembered
!wait 0.5
!mouseto 1044 770
!button left down
!button left up
!wait 0.6
!screenshot build/tray-1.png
!mouseto 960 374
!button left down
!button left up
!wait 0.6
!screenshot build/tray-2.png
!mouseto 960 374
!button left down
!button left up
!wait 0.4
!mouseto 120 400
!button left down
!button left up
!key ticks
!wait 0.5
ticks=
